Yes, we're the Superpowers, Superpowers.

72
00:05:02,180 --> 00:05:05,040
Yes, we're the Superpowers.

73
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:09,400
My, my, my, my!

74
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,271
Why are you running away?

75
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:14,180
Is it because you're
