76
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:22,537
Don't you remember what
you told me, Straw Hat?

77
00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:26,340
The first time we spoke when
you were on Fishman Island,

78
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:30,560
