Well then, Monkey D.

80
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:42,040
Luffy, now that I know
who you are, come here.

81
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:44,420
Let's chat in the new world.

82
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,500
I like this island.

83
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:49,938
