84
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:54,000
Once I get there, I'm gonna kick your ass.

85
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:57,900
And then I'll make Fishman
Island my territory.

86
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:03,860
And do you remember what you said to me
when you were captured in my library?

87
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:07,177
Something about making
me sorry, if I recall.

88
