You haven't become King of the
Pirates, and that's on you.

89
00:06:12,660 --> 00:06:14,297
Nothing else to it.

90
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:16,760
Get over here and fight me!

91
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:20,780
I'm not backing down Even
if you are an emperor!

92
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:23,476
I'm taking Sanji back no matter what!

93
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:26,660
I'm gonna turn this all
around and make you sorry!

94
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:29,240
And now you want to run?

95
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:32,080
I guess you're all talk!

96
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,340
I'm all talk?

97
00:06:38,340 --> 00:06:40,360
She's just trying to provoke you!

98
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,442
Just one punch!

99
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,220
Hey, come back!

100
