Oh, excellent work!

106
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:55,800
It sure is nice having
human shields! It's over!

107
00:07:57,060 --> 00:07:59,660
No betrayal shall go unpunished!

108
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:02,460
I'll burn you to death with my own hands!

109
