114
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:26,417
If you're looking to get pounded in the
face, you're in the right place, though.

115
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:28,382
That's some faceless confidence.

116
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:30,937
We're almost there, kid, just keep it up.

117
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:33,260
