You're clear. What? Really?

135
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:57,300
A candy wall?

136
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,400
You saved me!

137
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:03,000
I'm sorry I ever doubted you!

138
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:06,497
These German guys were
really something else.

139
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:07,817
They wrecked that candy!

140
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:09,060
Yo le no!

141
00:10:12,300 --> 00:10:13,700
So scum-do!

142
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,720
I'm so close!

143
