Now that I've made it this far,
I really don't want to die!

144
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,020
Freedom within my sight!

145
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:24,240
Maybe it's... the candy!

146
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:25,720
But I swear!

147
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:28,180
It tastes so sweet!

148
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:35,000
