someplace more convenient.

151
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,260
I can't miss this.

152
00:10:44,460 --> 00:10:45,440
I gotta jump.

153
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:48,759
What are you going to do
with that treasure, Dufeld?

154
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:50,720
Huh? Who is that?

155
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:54,300
