Ow, ow, ow, ow.

157
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,240
That's smart.

158
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,460
But it'll all be worth it.

159
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:11,220
The treasure of the deep.

160
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:14,440
Whatever it is, it's got
to be something good.

161
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:23,720
Flying Finger Pistol.

162
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:26,997
The world government will
be claiming the Tomatei Box.

163
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,910
Thank you.

164
00:11:31,820 --> 00:11:32,897
But don't worry.

165
00:11:32,980 --> 00:11:36,274
I'll still let you take the
blame for its disappearance.

166
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:41,800
I trust that's the story you'll be
writing in your papers, Morgans. Busted!

167
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:46,100
As long as I can spy what's inside first.

168
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:47,794
Look, but don't touch.

169
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:49,757
I'm sure a professional spin doctor such

170
