You're next.

177
00:12:30,260 --> 00:12:31,090
Hey! Crap!

178
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:36,000
You said just one punch and you got it!

179
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,740
Kaido, you said.

180
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:40,320
My, my, my, my.

181
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,628
If that little punch
is the best you've got,

182
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:46,152
