207
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:01,111
Can't you just let me go?

208
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,190
What a pity.

209
00:15:03,273 --> 00:15:05,120
And you were so close, too.

210
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:21,052
Don't worry, I haven't abandoned my duty.

211
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,517
You better get moving.

212
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,424
You don't have to ask me twice!

213
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:29,160
