Keep firing!

218
00:15:47,180 --> 00:15:48,840
Don't let them escape! Yeah!

219
00:15:49,220 --> 00:15:50,280
You can make it!

220
00:15:50,540 --> 00:15:51,940
We're counting on you!

221
00:15:52,340 --> 00:15:53,575
You got this, Caesar!

222
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:56,400
You scumbag! Hold on!

223
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:57,992
What was that last part?

224
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,960
Don't get in my way!

225
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:08,110
Ah?

226
00:16:08,193 --> 00:16:09,200
Move it, you moron!

227
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:11,160
Who the hell are you, anyway?

228
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:15,600
You're me?

229
00:16:16,060 --> 00:16:18,100
Wait, that doesn't make sense.

230
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:20,520
It's me, you fool.

231
00:16:20,820 --> 00:16:22,000
Take a good look.

232
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:24,640
Ah, Barrel!

233
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:28,420
