234
00:16:28,740 --> 00:16:32,697
Why, I had so much resentment
piling up, I hardly knew what to do.

235
00:16:32,780 --> 00:16:36,839
Now I get to take it all out on you
and your insufferable associates.

236
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:42,120
Just got ugly.

237
00:16:42,540 --> 00:16:43,560
Look, Caesar.

238
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:57,520
