239
00:17:00,700 --> 00:17:02,400
It's not fair!

240
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:16,020
This might be it.

241
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:20,020
So what do we do?

242
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:21,620
German, no!

243
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:26,297
our escape plan has failed they won't rest

244
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:30,420
to her all dead are you
giving up not at all

245
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:37,780
but the road ahead is a harsh one

246
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:46,397
anything beats waiting
for death thankfully i've

247
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:49,497
still got a bit of fight
left in me i'm going to Yeah,

248
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:50,410
me too!

249
00:17:50,493 --> 00:17:52,420
And we'll help get your back, too.

250
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:54,240
If this is the only way.

251
00:18:10,180 --> 00:18:11,860
We were so close, too!

252
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:25,260
Well, the party's over.

253
00:18:26,540 --> 00:18:28,960
But the executions are next.

254
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:50,100
